pwm1:m:Chapter 1 - The Portal
One peaceful day in Korea, Lora was playing with her brother in the garden. Lora said, ''tomorrow at school we are going on a school trip-"OW!'' - her brother threw a ball at Lora. She went up to her room and sighed. Then something caught her eye -a sword! She picked it up and swished it twice and a mysterious portal appeared in front of her. She went through.   
Chapter 2 - The Place
As soon as Lora stepped through the portal, she saw a different world. She found a very formal temple -''where am I'' exclaimed Lora. Then she spotted a funny looking guard with the head of a fly and was staring at her ''Do you have what the King has asked?'' said the guard as he snatched the sword from Lora. ''HEY'' shouted Lora ''Give it BACK! Oh well, it IS very useless''. But she was wrong.                          Chapter 3 - The Ending 
''Ummm... WHERE IS THE PORTAL?'' shouted Lora ''Sorry!'' said the guard ''I need that to get HOME!'' 
 said Lora. She  chased the guard and eventually got the sword and opened the portal, threw the sword back inside the weird place and she escaped. But her whole family was staring at her.   
                                                                               THE END                                                                                  